OL,3,AUK salmonella cases nearing 500 as egg
OL,4,Ainvestigations continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FClose to 500 people have become ill
OL,7,Fwith salmonella linked to imported
OL,8,Feggs, say UK authorities, who say they
OL,9,Fhave identified two new clusters of the
OL,10,Finfection.
OL,12,FThe UK Health Security Agency reported
OL,13,F207 cases last week. That has been
OL,14,Fincreased to 259, with the two new
OL,15,Fclusters bringing the total to 474.
OL,16,FThere have been two deaths recorded.
OL,18,FSome of the cases date back a year, but
OL,19,Fall involve bacteria that are almost
OL,20,Fgenetically identical, suggesting a
OL,21,Fcommon food source.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
